# Cloudflare Pages Redirects & SPA Fallback
# Canonicalize /blogs to /blog
/blogs  /blog  301
/blogs/*  /blog/:splat  301
# Canonicalize /previous-events to /events
/previous-events  /events  301
/previous-events/*  /events/:splat  301
# Static files and pre-rendered pages match first. Unmatched dynamic paths fallback to index.html with HTTP 200 for client hydration.
/*  /index.html  200

